msgstr "**s132** --- atât periferic, cât și central."

#: ../../library/ubluepy.rst:23
msgid ""
"**s110** --- peripheral only; scanner / connect methods are compiled out."
msgstr ""
"**s110** --- doar periferic; metodele de scanare / conectare sunt excluse la"
" compilare."

