"Namespace of advertising-data AD-type constants from the `Bluetooth Core "
"Specification Supplement "
"<https://www.bluetooth.com/specifications/specs/core-specification-"
"supplement-12/>`_. Each name maps to the corresponding 1-byte AD type:"
msgstr ""
"Spațiu de nume al constantelor de tip AD pentru datele de advertising din "
"`Bluetooth Core Specification Supplement "
"<https://www.bluetooth.com/specifications/specs/core-specification-"
"supplement-12/>`_\\ . Fiecare nume se mapează la tipul AD corespunzător de 1"
" octet:"

